'''Eye of the Storm''' (暴風一家, ''Bōfū Ikka'', '''Storm Family''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (M): Cats' health increases by 20%.

